    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Gravarior? </h2>It is a shooting action puzzle game in which the player manipulates gravity up and down to conquer the numerous gimmicks inside a discarded ship.<br>Take control of the main character, Grabber, as he tries to steal the energy hidden deep inside the discarded ship.<br>Obstacles such as walls blocking the way and the mysterious creature Anoi are waiting for you inside the waste ship, so use gravity to overcome the difficulties!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>.There is an energy reaction! There is an energy reaction!&quot;<br>Glover is collecting main energy from discarded spaceships.<br>It's a get-rich-quick job in today's energy-starved Earth.<br>Recently, there are gravity manipulators that make it much easier to operate in space.<br>What is that? What is that?<br>Glover happily climbs aboard the abandoned spaceship, but what he sees is a creature that looks like an octopus on Earth.<br>But it is not an octopus. It had a body length comparable to Glover's and one large eye.<br>---Pow!<br>Glover punches out the eye without hesitation.<br>Sorry...we're risking our lives here, too.<br>Go on, Glover! Beat the mysterious creature and get rich!",
